{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56231","headline":"赞念法华经僧 · 贯休","name":"赞念法华经僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空王门下有真子，堪以空王爲了使。\n常持菡萏《白莲经》，屈指无人得相似。\n长松下，深窗里，历历清香韵宫徴。\n短偈长行主客分，不使闲声挂牙齿。\n外人闻，耸双耳，香风袭鼻寒毛起。\n只见天花落座前，空中必定有神鬼。\n吾师吾师须努力，年深已是成功积。\n桑田变海骨爲尘，相看长似红莲色。\n（见斯四○三七卷。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56231.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56231","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}